    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>WonderLang</strong>, where mastering a new language transforms into an <strong>engaging RPG journey</strong>. Immerse yourself in captivating quests, interactive dialogues, and fun puzzles <strong>designed to make language learning seamless and enjoyable</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang weaves language into the core of its adventure and compelling narrative. Get immersed in Wonderlang, as you: <strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>Fight</strong>, <strong>Converse</strong> and <strong>Investigate</strong> using your <strong>target language</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>More affordable</strong>, <strong>more engaging</strong>, and <strong>way more fun</strong> than any subscription-based <strong>language learning app</strong>!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/54ca8ef42134991cf18b18b054ee353d.avif?t=1753375743\" data-has-big width=800 height=221 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang is designed for <strong>beginner language learners</strong>, allowing you to dive into the game without any prior knowledge of the language. While the game doesn't aim to fully replace traditional language courses, it provides an <strong>immersive and enjoyable way to practice </strong>a new language gradually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Languages Available Now: French, German, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese, Korean &amp;\u00a0 Japanese.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Language:  Japanese (in Early Access).  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/9b42f31feeba5491c5cea8ba1a19c19b.avif?t=1753375743\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Language Learning</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn practical Language through every conversation, quest, and puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modes for very beginners, A1 level learners (TOPIK1, N5) and A2 (TOPIK2, N4)  level learners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>40 to 50 hours of combined learning and gameplay</strong>.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/464b08879c0b2fcdd0cff6903400a305.poster.avif?t=1753375743\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/464b08879c0b2fcdd0cff6903400a305.webm?t=1753375743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/464b08879c0b2fcdd0cff6903400a305.mp4?t=1753375743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Storyline</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the journey of a young hero who must learn Language to lift a magical curse from their brother.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vibrant villages, uncover secrets, and build friendships interracting with over 60 unique NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/0a0baa266e63a02e5d325fe8624974b9.poster.avif?t=1753375743\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/0a0baa266e63a02e5d325fe8624974b9.webm?t=1753375743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/0a0baa266e63a02e5d325fe8624974b9.mp4?t=1753375743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning as a Gameplay Mechanic</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, and complete quests by forming sentences and understanding dialogues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice building sentences and pronunciation thanks to speech recognition challenges (On Windows only for the moment).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize in-game tools like a dictionary and contextual help to aid your learning.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spaced Repetition Combat Challenges</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in <strong>language-based combat</strong>\u00a0to reinforce language retention.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat challenges are designed using the <strong>spaced repetition principle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/7918171af313910ab537cf0af37b147d.poster.avif?t=1753375743\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/7918171af313910ab537cf0af37b147d.webm?t=1753375743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/7918171af313910ab537cf0af37b147d.mp4?t=1753375743\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World Context Practice</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply your Language skills in <strong>everyday scenarios</strong> such as buying groceries or making an appointment at the doctor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience practical vocabulary and grammar in <strong>real-world contexts</strong> to enhance your language proficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Learning Experience</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your learning journey with various difficulty settings to make the experience more or less challenging based on your preference.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set <strong>daily goals</strong> and earn rewards for reaching them, helping you build a consistent learning routine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Interactive World</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore exotic locations</strong>, each introducing specific vocabulary and grammar rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in <strong>mini-games</strong> like crosswords, memory games, and charades to diversify your learning experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo available on our website: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/6e46f68cb2492ee721f0862c735137dd.poster.avif?t=1753375743\" width=74 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/6e46f68cb2492ee721f0862c735137dd.webm?t=1753375743\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single Languages Versions are Already Out!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find them on the Franchise Page or Developper Page:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang French</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang German</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang Portuguese</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang Italian</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang Korean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WonderLang Japanese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are cheaper versions of the game that feature one language to learn only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/ccdf73f1ea974747a06efb92cb695755.poster.avif?t=1753375743\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/ccdf73f1ea974747a06efb92cb695755.apng?t=1753375743\" class=\"bb_img\" width=89 height=90 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/939ca7fb7c6ef58353da17d0ff77dd07.poster.avif?t=1753375743\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599480/extras/939ca7fb7c6ef58353da17d0ff77dd07.apng?t=1753375743\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=98 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul>",
